category: Libs
requires: cygwin libavcodec63 libavfilter12 libavformat63 libavutil61 libgcc1 libjpeg8 libpng16 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Lightweight video thumbnailer (runtime)"
ldesc: "FFmpegthumbnailer is a lightweight video thumbnailer that can be used by file
managers to create thumbnails for your video files. The thumbnailer uses
ffmpeg to decode frames from the video files, so supported videoformats depend
on the configuration flags of ffmpeg."
external-source: ffmpegthumbnailer

